# =============================================================================
# Shared Protocol Headers - Fetched from Water-Controller
# =============================================================================
#
# These files are downloaded at build time from:
#   github.com/mwilco03/Water-Controller/shared/include/
#
# DO NOT:
#   - Edit these files locally (changes will be overwritten)
#   - Commit .h files to this directory
#   - Copy-paste from these files into other code
#
# Instead:
#   - #include the headers and use the defined constants
#   - Submit protocol changes to Water-Controller repo
#   - Re-run fetch_shared_protocols.sh after controller updates
#
# See: docs/RTU_SHARED_PROTOCOL_SYNC.md
# =============================================================================

# Ignore all .h files (they are fetched, not committed)
*.h

# But track this .gitignore
!.gitignore
